BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 375.27 Tm (renew. Every month therefore serves nine customers and bills $56,250. Nonrenewals remove future volume) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 360.05 Tm (rather than reversing accepted prior service. The unusually visible churn forces the operator to prove) Tj ET
